  "explanation": "The question asks 'When was the PMK founded?' and the relevant documents clarify that the Pattali Makkal Katchi (PMK) was founded by S. Ramadoss on 16 July 1989 (D1S4). The other candidate, '1981', refers to the People's Movement of Kosovo (also abbreviated as PMK in D2S1), which is a distinct entity unrelated to the Tamil Nadu-based PMK. Since the question refers to the PMK in the context of Tamil Nadu, only '16 July 1989' is valid."
